@startuml
' Shared look for every diagram: plain black-and-white UML, course style.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
  HeaderBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam actorBorderColor #000000
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam packageBorderColor #000000
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam artifactBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam stateBorderColor #000000
skinparam objectBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam objectBorderColor #000000
skinparam entityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam boundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam controlBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam noteBorderColor #888888
skinparam titleFontSize 14
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign left
title Thiết kế – Biểu đồ tuần tự thiết kế – Track Invoice 0 (21 bước, kịch bản v3)

actor "Khách hàng" as A
boundary "gdCustomerHome.jsp" as gdCustomerHome
boundary "gdInvoiceList.jsp" as gdInvoiceList
boundary "gdInvoiceDetail.jsp" as gdInvoiceDetail
control "InvoiceDAO" as InvoiceDAO
entity "Invoice" as Invoice

A -> gdCustomerHome : 1: click Theo dõi hóa đơn
gdCustomerHome -> gdInvoiceList : 2: gọi
gdInvoiceList -> InvoiceDAO : 3: gọi
InvoiceDAO -> InvoiceDAO : 4: getInvoiceByCustomer(idCustomer)
InvoiceDAO -> Invoice : 5: gọi
Invoice -> Invoice : 6: Invoice()
Invoice --> InvoiceDAO : 7: trả về
InvoiceDAO --> gdInvoiceList : 8: trả về
gdInvoiceList --> A : 9: hiển thị
A -> gdInvoiceList : 10: click HD1024
gdInvoiceList -> gdInvoiceDetail : 11: gọi
gdInvoiceDetail -> InvoiceDAO : 12: gọi
InvoiceDAO -> InvoiceDAO : 13: getInvoiceDetail(idInvoice, idCustomer)
InvoiceDAO -> Invoice : 14: gọi
Invoice -> Invoice : 15: Invoice()
Invoice --> InvoiceDAO : 16: trả về
InvoiceDAO --> gdInvoiceDetail : 17: trả về
gdInvoiceDetail --> A : 18: hiển thị
A -> gdInvoiceDetail : 19: click Quay lại
gdInvoiceDetail -> gdInvoiceList : 20: gọi
gdInvoiceList --> A : 21: hiển thị
@enduml
